# Time tacker API

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1/tasks


### POST the TaskList
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "task" : "drive",
    "hr": 10
   
    

}


### GET the TaskList
GET {{baseUrl}}

### UPDATE the TaskList
PATCH {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
     "_id": "6a16a69b5f0db1a4c32cd624",
    "hr": 20,
    "type":"bad"
}

### DELETE the TaskList
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/6a16a69b5f0db1a4c32cd624